+K6 source derives from changh95/bevfusion-p150, Apache-2.0.
+https://huggingface.co/changh95/bevfusion-p150/tree/300095a42e61075a3d5c9916620344c1067200b8
+
+The four kernel files retain original SPDX notices. Local kernel changes:
+copy_init renamed to copy_tile_init for the pinned TT-Metal SDK. The Python
+layer is trimmed to the required program builder, fixed to HiFi3 and explicit
+prepared weights, with environment-controlled debug paths removed. FlexGEMM's
+wrapper guards physical multicast coordinates and CB feasibility, runs four
+integer products and provides an explicit-GEMM fallback. No original author
+endorsement is implied. See K6-LICENSE and the iteration-016/017 source archives.
